video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unlock the Exit:</strong> There is no other option. Find a way, or decay in the abyss.<br></li><li><strong>Threats:</strong> Beware of the <strong>Unknown</strong>. Will you confront them head-on, sneak past them, or use your wits to outmaneuver what's lurking in the shadows.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2233660/extras/ff7f573231974d557dc2ebbb80280f1e.poster.avif?t=1718788464\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2233660/extras/ff7f573231974d557dc2ebbb80280f1e.webm?t=1718788464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></li></ul>",
